cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this manifest or linter, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "derives-from: a derivation manifest for public statistical data, with a lineage linter"
abstract: >-
  A machine readable record of what public statistical products are computed
  from, covering 60 data products and 75 derivation edges, together with a
  linter that refuses any covariate lying on a derivation path to or from the
  prediction target, and a script that reproduces the leakage demonstration
  from the live CDC Social Vulnerability Index file.
authors:
  - family-names: Adeniyi
    given-names: Kayode
    affiliation: Independent researcher
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-03"
license: CC0-1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Adeniyikayodee/dependency_manifest"
keywords:
  - data provenance
  - data lineage
  - target leakage
  - feature selection
  - official statistics
  - reproducibility
